---
import MotionReveal from '../motion/MotionReveal.astro';
---

<section
  id="how-i-work"
  class="scroll-mt-[var(--site-header-height)] border-b-2 border-surface-border bg-surface px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-24 lg:px-8 lg:py-28"
  aria-labelledby="how-i-work-heading"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1400px]">
    <MotionReveal class="max-w-2xl space-y-8" data-scroll-wipe>
      <div class="space-y-5">
        <p class="brutal-label">How I work</p>
        <h2
          id="how-i-work-heading"
          class="font-display text-[clamp(2.25rem,5vw,3.75rem)] font-bold uppercase leading-[0.92] tracking-tight text-paper"
        >
          Built for people who are busy.
        </h2>
        <p class="max-w-xl text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-paper/75">
          Service background taught me: real people interact with tools when they're tired or rushed. That shaped how I
          think about shipping.
        </p>
        <p class="max-w-xl text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-paper/75">
          What you get: scoped client work that ships on time. Production habits from real sprints. Honest conversations
          about what's feasible and what's not. Fewer surprises, clearer next steps.
        </p>
      </div>
    </MotionReveal>
  </div>
</section>
